30--> IPv4 vs IPv6

		Feature	              IPv4	                IPv6
		Version	               4	                 6
		Address size	     32 bits	             128 bits
		Format	             Numbers with dots	     Hexadecimal with colons
		Example	             192.168.1.10	          2001:db8::1
